 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "MinMaxQueue() creates an empty queue. enqueue(val) adds val at the back. dequeue() removes and returns the front element. getMin() and getMax() return the smallest and largest element currently in the queue. dequeue, getMin and getMax are only called on a non-empty queue. Every method call is answered in call order on one instance; void methods return nothing.",
